                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1372703-6737-438a-8788-bc9a1f747c2a",
                                "sense_id": "fef056f1-8b8b-384d-be03-9f0cfc890b4c",
                                "text": "But these first theorists and programmists of communism, who conceived their programmes after the fashion of an economic enterprise, a hygienic reform, or an educational institution[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b689613c-5c08-4001-85f8-e850c8c9c549",
                                "sense_id": "fef056f1-8b8b-384d-be03-9f0cfc890b4c",
                                "text": "In Quebec in 1875 he was ultramontane, programmist, out-Veuilloting Veuillot, swearing by Mgr. Bourget and Mgr. Lafleche[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cf92488-a135-33af-b8d0-dc06060e6b02",
                        "entry_id": "59dfdbae-5b25-3188-932c-ec2b88920328",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A composer of program music."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
